WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:03.128
So this is pretty much like the
comedy workshop we do on Zoom

00:00:03.128 --> 00:00:04.462
but it's gonna be in person

00:00:04.462 --> 00:00:06.423
and we're gonna do
a show in four days.

00:00:06.423 --> 00:00:08.800
We must do our exercises.

00:00:11.094 --> 00:00:12.387
You're gonna go
through the curtain

00:00:12.387 --> 00:00:14.389
and you're gonna
grab this microphone.

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:17.767
I wanna thank you all for
coming to my bar mitzvah.

00:00:18.935 --> 00:00:21.229
A man goes to the doctor
and the doctor says,

00:00:21.229 --> 00:00:23.440
"You know, you have
to stop masturbating."

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:24.524
He goes, "Why?"

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:26.568
He says, "Because I'm
trying to examine you."

00:00:28.653 --> 00:00:30.155
Thank you all for being here.

00:00:30.155 --> 00:00:32.824
Has anyone been to a 2pm
comedy show before?

00:00:34.659 --> 00:00:35.785
Oh my god!

00:00:35.785 --> 00:00:37.662
My wife left me recently.

00:00:38.663 --> 00:00:39.998
He's so naughty.

00:00:40.498 --> 00:00:42.542
Life is a performance.

00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:43.793
Then there was my head surgery.

00:00:44.878 --> 00:00:46.963
If my boss ever sees
this, I'm dead.

00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:50.717
Laughter is like food
you put in your body.

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:54.512
I would like to be funny but
not in an artificial way.

00:00:54.512 --> 00:00:56.097
You know? Genuinely funny.

00:00:56.097 --> 00:00:57.766
I think that you
are genuinely funny.

00:00:57.766 --> 00:00:58.349
You do?

00:00:58.349 --> 00:00:59.059
Yeah.

00:00:59.059 --> 00:00:59.768
Really?

00:00:59.768 --> 00:01:00.268
Yes.

00:01:00.268 --> 00:01:01.978
You're the first person
who's ever told me that.

